 If InKind='mp4' Then ReadMP4 Else If InKind='avi' Then ReadAVI Else If InKind=
 'webm' Then ReadWebM Else Fail('Conteneur video inconnu.');
 RemoveAudioTracks; PrepareTracks;
 If AspectNum>0 Then Begin
  I:=0;
